    --      (불일치 = 가입캠페인 ≠ 최초개발캠페인 회원 · 둘은 다른 정의다).
    c.CMMN_BRND                                   as JOIN_CMMN_BRND,
    c.CMMN_BRND_NM                                as JOIN_CMMN_BRND_NM
from GN_DW.GOLD.DIM_MEMBER_STATUS_HISTORY h
left join GN_DW.SILVER.CRM_MEMBER   m on m.MEMBER_DK = h.MEMBER_DK
left join GN_DW.SILVER.CRM_CAMPAIGN c on c.CMPGN_CD  = m.CMPGN_CD
where h.IS_CURRENT
  );
